    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Changing the Restriction\r\n\r\nSystem prompts can be used to focus how a chatbot responds. One way to do this is to give it an **explicit restriction or limitation** to focus what it responds to.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Update the chatbot so it can also answer questions about driving laws in other states, but still redirects back to the laws and regulations in Arizona.\r\n    - Don't erase the entire prompt; just modify the relevant parts of the prompt and see how it changes.\r\n\r\nTest the chatbot! Type in a message and press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Continue</code> button!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* What are the requirements to get a driving permit?\r\n* What happens if you run a red light?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
